				<title>(no title)</title>
				<link>http://www.scpwiki.com/forum/t-312265/scp-913#post-4310329</link>
				<description></description>
				<pubDate>Fri, 19 Jul 2019 19:22:50 +0000</pubDate>
				<wikidot:authorName>SpookyJiggles</wikidot:authorName>				<wikidot:authorUserId>5041916</wikidot:authorUserId>				<content:encoded>
					<![CDATA[
						 <p>I wish there was more on this SCP, to give off more of his personality, or more horror. You could even do both, maybe an interview with him a couple days after a containment breach where his catheter malfunctioned. He could be remorseful from the facility damage and staff casualties he inflicted, I dunno. Regardless, it’s alright, I’ll upvote for the effect I haven’t seen before, but it still feels lacking. The other Misters have personality, even if some have more than others.<br /> +1</p> 
				 	]]>
				</content:encoded>							</item>
